# Competency question (native gmeow:reasoningLogic lane): "Is math:coarserNormalizationThan's
# owl:TransitiveProperty characteristic a LIVE entailment, not merely three adjacent
# assertions?" module.ttl asserts ONLY the three ADJACENT links of the four-rung ladder —
# semantic->algebraic, algebraic->commutative, commutative->structural — never the
# two-hop-plus link from the COARSEST rung (math:semanticNormalization) directly to the
# FINEST (math:structuralNormalization). This ASK can only succeed if the native logic:
# reasoner's owl:TransitiveProperty chase genuinely derives that direct link from the three
# adjacent facts; over the merged (asserted-only) graph it is absent.
PREFIX math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/>

ASK {
    math:semanticNormalization math:coarserNormalizationThan math:structuralNormalization .
}
